// online_stubs_cppwebapi_gen.go). Fixture of every bound import (library, NID, name):
// testdata/online_stub_imports.txt. A name binds by plain name and, through initCanonicalNIDMap,
// by the NID derived from it.
//
// These are ordinary (not fallback) shims, like the other HLE modules; they live in their own file
// so the large shims.go tables stay untouched.

